{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chengguo-e-o143","title":"济凿地蹴船开遏入淮全致船艘","accounts":[{"id":"chengguo-a-caf1e21df7720646ecf4","label":"正文","text":"济凿地蹴船开遏入淮全致船艘","evidence":["chengguo-q-9084dcc832db5c97d0c0"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0009","role":"尽留船付济、更凿地作四五道蹴船令聚、豫作土豚遏断湖水皆引后船、一时开遏入淮中","evidence":["chengguo-q-9084dcc832db5c97d0c0"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"水稍尽、还洛阳谓济曰事不可不晓、吾前决谓分半烧船于山阳池中卿于后致之略与吾俱至谯、自今讨贼计画善思论之","evidence":["chengguo-q-9084dcc832db5c97d0c0"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chengguo-q-9084dcc832db5c97d0c0"]},"ordering_evidence":"chengguo-q-9084dcc832db5c97d0c0","source_order":[14,389,99],"order":3153}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0009","name":"蒋济","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-9084dcc832db5c97d0c0","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-22837236f2eb5e6e535c","layer":"original","quote":"还到精湖〖8〗，水稍尽，尽留船付济。船本历适数百里中〖9〗，济更凿地作四五道〖10〗，蹴船令聚〖11〗。豫作土豚遏断湖水〖12〗，皆引后船；一时开遏〖13〗，入淮中。帝还洛阳，谓济曰：“事不可不晓。吾前决谓‘分半烧船于山阳池中〖14〗’；卿于后致之，略与吾俱至谯。又每得所陈，实入吾意。自今讨贼计画，善思论之","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":388,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":99,"end":253,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
